  "text" : {
    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<div>\n    <table class=\"grid dict\">\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Id: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">MEASLES.DT.03</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Url: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><a href=\"PlanDefinition-MEASLES.DT.03.html\">MEASLES.DT.03 Count a recorded measles-containing vaccine dose</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Version: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">0.1.0</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Title: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">MEASLES.DT.03 Count a recorded measles-containing vaccine dose</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Status: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">draft</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Experimental: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">true</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Type: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                    \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>system: </b> <span><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.5.0/CodeSystem-plan-definition-type.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/plan-definition-type</a></span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>code: </b> <span>eca-rule</span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Date: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">2026-11-23 11:02:25+0000</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Publisher: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">WHO</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Description: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><div><p>How one recorded MCV dose counts, evaluated dose by dose in date order. Hit policy FIRST. Adjudication: pending. L3 of input/decision-logic/MEASLES.DT.03.dmn.</p>\n</div></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Libraries: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><a href=\"Library-MEASLESDT03.html\">MEASLES.DT.03 Count a recorded measles-containing vaccine dose (logic)</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Actions: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 1: not counted:</b> No written evidence: treat as not received and offer vaccination.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 1 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 2: invalid:</b> Given before the minimum age of 6 months: not valid; repeat as age-appropriate.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 2 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 3: MCV0:</b> Given before 9 months: a supplementary dose, recorded as MCV0; MCV1 and MCV2 still follow.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 3 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 4: invalid:</b> Less than 4 weeks after the previous MCV: not valid; repeat 4 weeks after this dose.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 4 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 5: MCV1:</b> The first valid routine dose, whatever it was recorded as.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 5 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 6: MCV2:</b> The second valid routine dose.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 6 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 7: extra:</b> Series already complete; this dose is not needed.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 7 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 8: unknown:</b> Not settled: the dose date, age or earlier doses are missing.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 8 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n    </table>\n</div>\n</div>"
  },
  "contained" : [{
    "resourceType" : "Library",
    "id" : "effective-data-requirements",
    "extension" : [{
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 1"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "/* Rule 1: catch-up guide, page 14 — CU:catchup.unconfirmed-assume-unvaccinated CU:catchup.confirm-by-written-record */\ndefine \"Rule 1\":\n  Coalesce(documented is false, false)"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 0
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 1 fires"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "define \"Rule 1 fires\":\n  \"Rule 1\""
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 1
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 2"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "/* Rule 2: catch-up guide, page 14; Table 1, page 3 (measles footnote) — CU:catchup.invalid-early-dose-repeat T1:measles.mcv0-situations */\ndefine \"Rule 2\":\n  Coalesce(ageAtDoseMonths < 6.0, false)"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 2
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 2 fires"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "define \"Rule 2 fires\":\n  \"Rule 2\" and not (\"Rule 1\")"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 3
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 8"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "/* Rule 8: No source: returned only when the inputs match no rule above (a fact is missing or out of range). */\ndefine \"Rule 8\":\n  Coalesce(true, false)"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 4
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 3"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "/* Rule 3: Table 1, page 3 (measles footnote) — T1:measles.mcv0-recording T1:measles.mcv0-then-routine-doses */\ndefine \"Rule 3\":\n  Coalesce(ageAtDoseMonths < 9.0, false)"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 5
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 4"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "/* Rule 4: Table 1, page 3 (measles footnote); catch-up guide, page 14 — T1:measles.mcv-minimum-interval CU:catchup.invalid-early-dose-repeat */\ndefine \"Rule 4\":\n  Coalesce(priorRoutineDoses >= 1.0\n    and weeksSincePreviousRoutine < 4.0, false)"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 6
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 5"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "/* Rule 5: catch-up guide, page 19 — CU:catchup.mcv2-only-after-mcv1. A dose is never counted as MCV2 without an MCV1. */\ndefine \"Rule 5\":\n  Coalesce(priorRoutineDoses < 1.0, false)"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 7
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 6"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "/* Rule 6: Table 1, page 3 (measles footnote) — T1:measles.mcv2-15-18-months */\ndefine \"Rule 6\":\n  Coalesce(priorRoutineDoses < 2.0, false)"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 8
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 7"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "/* Rule 7: Table 3, page 2 (measles row and footnote) — T3:measles.interrupted-delayed-schedule-row */\ndefine \"Rule 7\":\n  Coalesce(priorRoutineDoses >= 2.0, false)"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
        "valueInteger" : 9
      }],
      "url" : "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/cqf-logicDefinition"
    },
    {
      "extension" : [{
        "url" : "libraryName",
        "valueString" : "MEASLESDT03"
      },
      {
        "url" : "name",
        "valueString" : "Rule 8 fires"
      },
      {
        "url" : "statement",
        "valueString" : "define \"Rule 8 fires\":\n  \"Rule 8\" and not (\"Rule 1\" or \"Rule 2\" or \"Rule 3\" or \"Rule 4\" or \"Rule 5\" or \"Rule 6\" or \"Rule 7\")"
      },
      {
        "url" : "displaySequence",
